        "spya-s9msxy",
        "spya-bvx2u8"
      ],
      "title": "Millikan's Electron Charge",
      "gist": "Successive measurements of the electron's charge crept slowly upward from Millikan's flawed original value because researchers unconsciously distrusted results that strayed too far from his number, a documented bias scientists now guard against."
    },
