      ],
      "title": "The Danger of Not Repeating Experiments",
      "gist": "A Cornell student was discouraged from first replicating a prior rat experiment before changing conditions, and a similar shortcut at a modern particle accelerator shows institutional pressure for new results can undermine comparisons."
